:{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/RoundedTriangle":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/roundedtriangle","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RoundedTriangle"}],"title":"RoundedTriangle","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/RoundedTriangle","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RoundedTriangle"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An upward-pointing triangle with uniformly rounded corners."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}